#: ../source/overview.rst:5
#: fca9bdd1bd2746c4ab88d61280d99655
msgid "**Monitorfish** is a **fishing vessels monitoring software** developed by the French administration for the french **Fisheries Monitoring Center (FMC)** - the `Centre National de Surveillance des Pêches <https://www.mer.gouv.fr/la-police-des-peches>`_ - and its partners."
msgstr ""

#: ../source/overview.rst:8
#: 86627f9ccd33486fb9ac972d11b205f5
msgid "Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/overview.rst:11
#: f611395d39944cfe839b29ba9edcf4aa
msgid "Monitoring"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/overview.rst:13
#: eac1fd3e8d164c34b1048af6bdf3961f
msgid "Visualization of fishing vessels' real time **positions** (VMS and AIS) and tracks on a :doc:`map <map-and-layers>`, with regulatory and administrative zones"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/overview.rst:15
#: 2d3835daa1fa4a6c91d07e3d475fbadf
msgid "A :doc:`vessel sheet <vessel-sheet>` gathering each vessel's identity, declarative **fishing activity** (ERS logbook), :doc:`usual activity <vessel-profiles>`, **controls** history, :doc:`reportings` and VMS equipment"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/overview.rst:17
#: 104ca40252d143deaf460a0b3028d5ab
msgid "A :doc:`list of all vessels <vessel-list>` with advanced filters, and :doc:`groups of vessels <groups-of-vessels>` that can be shared"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/overview.rst:18
#: 6920a47a6f7b45e7a4dd0d721e978aa3
msgid "Real time fraud detection :doc:`alerts <alerts>`, including user-defined alerts, and :doc:`reportings`"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/overview.rst:19
#: 9420367425e84c48be74ff103e28a35a
msgid "Monitoring of :doc:`VMS beacon malfunctions <vms-beacon-monitoring>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/overview.rst:20
#: f9263a49e604476bbd9ff6f81854be16
msgid "Compliance checking of :doc:`prior notifications <prior-notifications>` of return to port, prioritization and distribution to control units for land inspections"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/overview.rst:24
#: 1bcb2ce1e81b4f82b221a50bd1a42f5f
msgid "Targeting"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/overview.rst:26
#: 960a263768504b9082c1cc599b7b8d74
msgid "Computation of fishing vessels' real time belonging to :doc:`fleet segments <fleet-segments>` as defined by the `European Fishing Control Agency (EFCA) <https://www.efca.europa.eu/en>`_ in its `risk assessment methodology <https://www.efca.europa.eu/en/content/guidelines-risk-assessment-methodology-fisheries-compliance>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/overview.rst:29
#: fb5d3b0cbbc04d308db4b77a1a175719
msgid "Computation of fishing vessels' real time :doc:`risk factor <risk-factor>`, a metric developed in the context of the Monitorfish project that aims to help FMC agents **prioritize vessels to control** based on all the above elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/overview.rst:31
#: fcdcc0b8e0de4663ba09b981c0c2ea99
msgid ":doc:`Control priority steering <control-priority-steering>` by dynamically adjusting the control priority level of each fleet segment"
msgstr ""

#: ../source/overview.rst:32
#: 4665bd1794ff4b0a9027769f7d2de4b1
msgid "Synthetic :doc:`activity overview <activity-overview>` to plan inspections"
msgstr ""

